# oracle: pair_style srp/react with fix bond/break (src/MISC/pair_srp_react.cpp and fix_srp_react.cpp at b332f28, ported in src/engine-gpl/srp): examples/PACKAGES/srp_react/in.srp_react (gel_equil.dat: 11017 atoms, 892 bonds) with the break probability raised to 0.05 and 40 steps; every 10 steps fix bond/break breaks bonds of type 2, the bond particles are made again after that neighbor build, and the counts of the bond fix are reset (f_break[1] shows 0, as native).
# oracle-examples: PACKAGES/srp_react/gel_equil.dat
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
variable       rseeddpd  equal  26817
variable       rseedvel  equal  5991
variable       breakstep equal  10
variable       probbreak  equal 0.05
variable       rseedbreak equal 6777
units          lj
atom_style     molecular
boundary       p  p  p
bond_style     harmonic
comm_modify    cutoff 4.0 vel yes
read_data   gel_equil.dat
group          Npoly         type   1 2 3 4
group          water         type   5
group          N_all         type   1 2 3 4 5
fix            break  N_all     bond/break  ${breakstep}   2   0  prob   ${probbreak}    ${rseedbreak}
mass             *   1.0
bond_coeff       *   500.0   0.70
special_bonds  lj   1  1  1
newton         on
pair_style     hybrid dpd  1.0  1.0  ${rseeddpd} srp/react 0.8 * mid break
pair_coeff     *5     *5   dpd   78.000    4.5   1.0
pair_coeff     *4      5   dpd   79.500    4.5   1.0
pair_coeff     *5      6   none
pair_coeff      6      6   srp/react   80.00 0.800
velocity       all create 1.0 ${rseedvel} dist gaussian mom yes
neighbor       0.3 bin
neigh_modify   every 1 delay 5 check  no
timestep       0.02
fix            1  all  nve
thermo         10
thermo_style   custom step temp pe ke etotal epair atoms f_break[1] f_break[2]
thermo_modify  norm  no format float %.15g
reset_timestep 0
run           40
